      "comment": "Our description: Traupman and Morgan–Owens have no word for a bug report. <span lang=\"la\">Relātiō</span> is classically a report or a motion laid before the senate (Cic. Pis. 29, in Lewis &amp; Short), and <span lang=\"la\">mendum</span> the lexicon’s word for a bug (see bug)."
